 phenyload:['NHS Borders — estado de mal epiléptico em adultos','https://www.rightdecisions.scot.nhs.uk/nhs-borders-clinical-guidelines/drugs-and-therapeutics/in-hospital-drug-treatment-of-convulsive-status-epilepticus-in-adults/'],
 phenyggc:['NHS GGC — cálculo e monitoramento de fenitoína','https://handbook.ggcmedicines.org.uk/guidelines/central-nervous-system/guideline-for-phenytoin-dose-calculations/'],
