 ukk:['UK Kidney Association — hipercalemia, 2023','https://www.ukkidney.org/sites/default/files/FINAL%20VERSION%20-%20UKKA%20CLINICAL%20PRACTICE%20GUIDELINE%20-%20MANAGEMENT%20OF%20HYPERKALAEMIA%20IN%20ADULTS%20-%20191223_0.pdf'],
