 lowNa:['Society for Endocrinology — hiponatremia sintomática, 2022','https://www.endocrinology.org/media/xhrhxhxm/emergency-management-of-severe-and-moderately-severely-symptomatic-hyponatraemia-in-adult-patients-2022.pdf'],
 ese:['ESE/ESICM/ERA — hiponatremia','https://academic.oup.com/ejendo/article/170/3/G1/6668028'],
